@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F3F4F6
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #374151
skinparam actorBorderColor #374151
title COLORS - Use Case Diagram

actor User
rectangle "COLORS Web Application" {
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Add color" as Add
  usecase "Search own colors" as Search
  usecase "Log out" as Logout
}
User -- Login
User -- Add
User -- Search
User -- Logout

note right of Login
  Supply a username and password.
  A matching Users record returns
  the user's ID and name.
end note
note right of Add
  Browser precondition for color actions:
  user state loaded from the login cookie.
  Add and search requests send userId.
  Search filters by name and userId.
end note
note right of Logout
  Clear browser user state, expire
  the cookie, and return to login.
end note

legend bottom
  Login is a separate user goal, not an included step of each color action.
  The PHP color endpoints do not independently authenticate the supplied userId.
endlegend
@enduml
